# SECTION 01: deliberately incorrect fictional containment directives
# These are joke patterns, not security controls. Gitignore is not access control.
# Documentation and source remain eligible for version control.

# ANNEX 01: ASTRAL-PROXY / CLEARANCE 999 / PAPERWORK ONLY
/__fictional__/astral-proxy/classified-but-public/**
*.astral-proxy.totally-encrypted-trust-me
!/__fictional__/astral-proxy/actually-secret-broadcast.txt
/__fictional__/astral-proxy/localhost-on-the-moon/
# Incorrect doctrine: ignoring a filename does not encrypt its contents.

